t (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dbb017d0-6385-41ff-ab78-651519235258")) (label "DIR2" (at 403.86 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2632a76c-f608-4721-a330-eab85da26e38")) (label "STEP2" (at 403.86 292.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7913e1dc-1cd5-4b09-8a6a-29ddc52537f9")) (label "DIR1" (at 403.86 294.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "62035819-40c5-4d35-968a-51fd708a3288")) (label "STEP1" (at 403.86 297.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "47670808-846d-4c2c-b9bc-0d896d77310a")) (text "CARNIVAL GAME - FULL WIRING DIAGRAM (every part, every pin, every connection)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 12.70 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "040900ad-96ff-4df5-8c87-97cbf317d439")) (text "Every line is a real wire between two pins. A dot is a joint; lines that cross without a dot do not touch.\nGROUND is drawn as the ground symbol at each pin (no ground wire runs round the sheet): every ground symbol is the same connection.\nParts are drawn to look like the real hardware: the GIGA board (top view, USB up) with every header pin, the TMC2209 StepSticks, NEMA17 motors,\nlever microswitches, the 16x2 LCD module, the MP3-TF-16P module, the WS2812B strip, the buck module and the 12 V PSU. X = pin not used.\nWIRE COLOURS  motor coil A: A1 black, A2 green / coil B: B1 red, B2 blue  |  +12V orange  +5V red  +3V3 purple  GND black  |  buttons teal  LCD brown  limit switches pink\n              STEP/DIR gold  MP3 serial navy  LED data cyan  speaker grey.  Every used GIGA pin has its signal name printed on its lead.\nNot yet confirmed on hardware: Track 1 limits 25/23 (guessed); Track 2, LCD and MP3 pins proposed. Confirmed 2026-09-30: buttons 35-43, Track 1 STEP 53 / DIR 51." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ec80c640-7d65-48bf-ad5f-6e851fef3269")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))